{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's Health and Wellness Column", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "It Is Never Too Late", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe unusual events through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Past Continuous Tense and the Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Past Continuous</span> tense to talk about an action that was happening at a time before now.  <br/>You use the <span class=\"italic\">Simple Past</span> to talk about a finished past action.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"italic\">Past Continuous</span> to:<ul><li>Describe the atmosphere at a particular time in the past.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">The children <span class=\"strong\">were laughing</span> and the birds <span class=\"strong\">were singing</span> in the park. A woman <span class=\"strong\">was looking</span> for her phone, which she dropped somewhere ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>Describe an action that was interrupted by another event or action\".</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I was looking through</span> my photos on Facebook <span class=\"strong\">when I became</span> disgusted with my appearance.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The form of the <span class=\"italic\">Past Continuous</span> is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">was</span>/<span class=\"italic\">were</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Simple Past</span> to talk about a shorter action or event that happened in the middle of, or interrupted, the longer action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">While I was checking my e-mail, <span class=\"strong\">I saw</span> a note from a devoted reader. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "While I was checking my e-mail, I saw a note from a devoted reader.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was looking through my photos on Facebook when I became disgusted with my appearance. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Gerunds and Infinitives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"strong\">gerund </span>  is a verb ending with <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">running</span>, <span class=\"italic\">breathing</span>, <span class=\"italic\">jumping</span>, <span class=\"italic\">playing</span>.<br/>An <span class=\"strong\">infinitive</span> is when a verb is preceded by the word <span class=\"italic\">to</span>. Examples: <span class=\"italic\">to run</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to breath</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to jump</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to play</span>. <br/>There are rules about which verbs are followed by gerunds and which verbs are followed by infinitives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Verbs that are followed by a gerund:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>anticipate</li><li>suggest</li><li>delay</li><li>complete</li><li>involve</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use gerunds after prepositions, for example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Anna took <span class=\"strong\">up running</span> at the age of 80.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<p>These are some verbs that are followed by an infinitive:</p><ul><li>choose</li><li>aim</li><li>expect</li><li>decide</li><li>help</li><li>happen</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">\u201cI <span class=\"strong\">chose to be</span> a young-at-heart athlete instead of an old woman\u201d, she says.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use Infinitives after adjectives. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">It's never too <span class=\"strong\">late to want</span> to make a change.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "There is no point in becoming downtrodden - use the negatives as an impetus for making a change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "His optimism is what prompted me to look ahead, not at the past.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "\u201cI chose to be a young-at-heart athlete instead of an old woman\u201d, she says.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "athlete ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person with high skills in physical agility and strength ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I chose to be a young-at-heart athlete.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "longevity ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the great duration of life", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What is the secret to Plenko's longevity?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "regimen ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "eating and exercising habits to preserve a person's health", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Plenko's exercise regimen is strict.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "daily food intake", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the amount of energy from food consumed in one day", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her dietary intake is really healthy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bill of health", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an account of physical health that a doctor usually gives ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Anna Plenko has a clean bill of health.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "downtrodden", "type": "name"}, {"content": "oppressed; with low energy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is no point in becoming downtrodden.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "impetus", "type": "name"}, {"content": "impulse; a force that moves one into action", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need an impetus for making a change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le12ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think about yourself as an \u201cold\u201d person. What do you see yourself doing?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the idea of being young-at-heart with your partner. What are ways to achieve this attitude?", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I think about and imagine myself as a \u201cold\u201d person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about staying healthy and how I am supposed to stay young-at-heart.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss ideas with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le12ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "\u201cIt's never too late to want to make a change,\u201d says 95-year-old track star Anna Plenko.\nAnna took up running at the age of 80. \u201cI chose to be a young-at-heart athlete instead of an old woman,\u201d she says."}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob11re2img02.jpg", "time": "14750", "id": 2, "text": "What is the secret to her longevity? Plenko says it is not only her strict exercise regimen and healthy daily food intake but also her positive outlook on life that accounts for her clean bill of health. <br/>\n\u201cIn my view, people are supposed to challenge themselves every day,\u201d she says. \u201cYou are not supposed to focus on the negative - only what you can do and how you can do it. There is no point in becoming downtrodden - use the negatives as an impetus for making a change."}, {"image": "engenn8le12ob11re2img03.jpg", "time": "45500", "id": 3, "text": "My husband was diagnosed with cancer. While I was taking care of him, I took a long look at myself and what I could do to live life to the fullest. My husband had a lot of time to help me turn my life around while he was receiving treatment. His optimism is what prompted me to look ahead, not at the past.\u201d<br/>\n\"It's not how old you are. It's how you get old. That's my motto,\" says Plenko."}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le12ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le12ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about my attitudes toward an action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what was happening when something else happened. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you know anyone who is young-at-heart? Who are they and how do they behave?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " In your opinion, what does it mean to be \u201cold\u201d?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's review!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Let's read a story about Anna Plenko - a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">young at heart</span> athlete.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "To be <span class=\"italic\">\"young at heart\"</span> means to think and act in a youthful way.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 